From 9238e15625e33724f36beede55495b730c6488ab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Adrian D'souza <adrdsouza@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:30:13 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] DevTools policy: denied on every app webview by default;
 content-only allowance for ViewRight; release gate

Owner design (fixed): no Right app exposes DevTools at any level; ViewRight alone exposes them, and only inside the HTML content it opens.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
